<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1885793385"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:01.386" ttm:agent="v2000"><div begin="11.312" end="1:05.230" itunes:songPart="Verse" ttm:agent="v1"><p begin="11.312" end="13.981" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="11.312" end="11.700">我从</span><span begin="11.700" end="11.997">一</span><span begin="11.997" end="12.184">个</span><span begin="12.184" end="12.997">又一个断片</span><span begin="12.997" end="13.237">的</span><span begin="13.237" end="13.660">片段中</span><span begin="13.660" end="13.981">醒来</span></p><p begin="13.981" end="16.615" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.981" end="14.299">所有</span><span begin="14.299" end="14.614">线</span><span begin="14.614" end="14.838">索</span><span begin="14.838" end="15.036">像</span><span begin="15.036" end="15.293">串</span><span begin="15.293" end="15.635">联在</span><span begin="15.635" end="15.936">现</span><span begin="15.936" end="16.291">实中</span><span begin="16.291" end="16.615">隐埋</span></p><p begin="16.615" end="19.161" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.615" end="17.597">穿过那些光鲜</span><span begin="17.597" end="17.869">亮</span><span begin="17.869" end="18.195">丽的</span><span begin="18.220" end="18.917">广告灯</span><span begin="18.917" end="19.161">品牌</span></p><p begin="19.161" end="21.820" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.161" end="19.487">只有</span><span begin="19.487" end="20.442">麻木的人在霾</span><span begin="20.442" end="20.843">里听</span><span begin="20.843" end="21.065">《我</span><span begin="21.065" end="21.438">不是</span><span begin="21.438" end="21.820">李白》</span></p><p begin="21.820" end="24.337" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.820" end="22.127">为什</span><span begin="22.127" end="22.383">幺</span><span begin="22.383" end="23.403">只有看着白鲸</span><span begin="23.403" end="23.680">嬉</span><span begin="23.680" end="23.878">笑</span><span begin="23.878" end="24.040">的</span><span begin="24.040" end="24.337">小孩</span></p><p begin="24.337" end="27.071" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.337" end="25.754">却不知道它们真正</span><span begin="25.834" end="26.016">的</span><span begin="26.016" end="26.300">故</span><span begin="26.300" end="26.715">乡是</span><span begin="26.715" end="27.071">大海</span></p><p begin="27.071" end="29.603" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.071" end="27.515">如果地</span><span begin="27.515" end="27.820">球</span><span begin="27.863" end="28.844">是母亲创造过</span><span begin="28.844" end="29.097">去</span><span begin="29.170" end="29.603">和现在</span></p><p begin="29.603" end="32.272" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.603" end="29.932">那麼</span><span begin="29.932" end="30.179">现</span><span begin="30.179" end="30.425">在</span><span begin="30.425" end="30.566">的</span><span begin="30.566" end="30.966">我们</span><span begin="30.966" end="31.732">能否给得了</span><span begin="31.732" end="32.272">未来</span></p><p begin="32.272" end="34.800" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.272" end="32.879">因为所有</span><span begin="32.879" end="33.031">的</span><span begin="33.031" end="33.358">快</span><span begin="33.358" end="34.403">乐会和痛苦是</span><span begin="34.403" end="34.800">正比</span></p><p begin="34.837" end="37.433" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.837" end="35.680">会有更多人</span><span begin="35.680" end="36.172">爱你</span> <span begin="36.172" end="36.965">就有多少人</span><span begin="36.965" end="37.433">恨你</span></p><p begin="37.433" end="40.034" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.433" end="38.112">不再充满</span><span begin="38.112" end="38.556">恨意</span> <span begin="38.747" end="39.741">我更多的只有</span><span begin="39.741" end="40.034">包容</span></p><p begin="40.034" end="42.533" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.034" end="41.373">希望每个人能理解</span><span begin="41.373" end="42.085">每个人的</span><span begin="42.085" end="42.249">不</span><span begin="42.249" end="42.533">同</span></p><p begin="42.614" end="45.139" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.614" end="43.980">所以这次我们回来</span><span begin="43.980" end="44.626">不是为了</span><span begin="44.626" end="44.840">复</span><span begin="44.840" end="45.139">仇</span></p><p begin="45.226" end="47.828" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.226" end="46.077">为了更多内</span><span begin="46.077" end="46.303">讧</span><span begin="46.303" end="46.491">住</span><span begin="46.491" end="46.750">手</span> <span begin="46.801" end="47.293">傻B</span><span begin="47.293" end="47.524">住</span><span begin="47.524" end="47.828">口</span></p><p begin="47.832" end="50.371" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.832" end="48.843">在这变了味的</span><span begin="48.843" end="49.193">长沙</span> <span begin="49.193" end="50.046">新的新民学</span><span begin="50.046" end="50.371">会</span></p><p begin="50.419" end="53.056" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.419" end="51.830">带着地下党的精兵</span><span begin="51.830" end="52.467">对抗精英</span><span begin="52.467" end="53.056">权贵</span></p><p begin="53.056" end="55.225" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.056" end="53.437">让他</span><span begin="53.437" end="53.688">们</span><span begin="53.688" end="54.374">倾听</span><span begin="54.374" end="54.542">再</span><span begin="54.542" end="55.225">学会</span></p><p begin="55.688" end="58.336" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.688" end="56.000">这世</span><span begin="56.000" end="56.336">间</span><span begin="56.336" end="56.655">好与</span><span begin="56.655" end="56.969">坏</span><span begin="56.969" end="57.314">其实</span><span begin="57.354" end="57.636">并</span><span begin="57.636" end="57.831">无</span><span begin="57.831" end="58.148">绝</span><span begin="58.148" end="58.336">对</span></p><p begin="58.336" end="1:01.236" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.336" end="58.680">那就</span><span begin="58.680" end="58.893">继</span><span begin="58.893" end="59.237">续</span><span begin="59.237" end="59.699">人间</span><span begin="59.699" end="59.976">游</span> <span begin="59.976" end="1:00.517">虽说</span><span begin="1:00.517" end="1:00.746">不</span><span begin="1:00.746" end="1:01.046">太</span><span begin="1:01.046" end="1:01.236">平</span></p><p begin="1:01.236" end="1:05.230" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.236" end="1:01.760">明知</span><span begin="1:01.760" end="1:02.063">山</span><span begin="1:02.063" end="1:02.271">有</span><span begin="1:02.271" end="1:02.508">虎</span> <span begin="1:02.561" end="1:03.147">偏向</span><span begin="1:03.147" end="1:03.790">虎山</span><span begin="1:03.790" end="1:05.230">行</span></p></div><div begin="1:03.803" end="1:24.038" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:03.803" end="1:08.701" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v2000"><span begin="1:03.803" end="1:04.812">一</span><span begin="1:04.812" end="1:05.134">往</span><span begin="1:05.134" end="1:07.732">无前虎山</span><span begin="1:07.732" end="1:08.701">行</span></p><p begin="1:08.701" end="1:13.724" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v2000"><span begin="1:08.701" end="1:09.061">拨</span><span begin="1:09.061" end="1:09.750">开</span><span begin="1:09.750" end="1:10.343">云雾</span><span begin="1:10.343" end="1:10.997">见</span><span begin="1:10.997" end="1:11.733">光</span><span begin="1:11.733" end="1:13.724">明</span></p><p begin="1:14.283" end="1:19.113" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v2000"><span begin="1:14.283" end="1:15.202">梦</span><span begin="1:15.202" end="1:15.550">里</span><span begin="1:15.550" end="1:18.210">花开牡丹</span><span begin="1:18.210" end="1:19.113">亭</span></p><p begin="1:19.113" end="1:24.038" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v2000"><span begin="1:19.113" end="1:19.474">幻</span><span begin="1:19.474" end="1:20.151">象</span><span begin="1:20.151" end="1:21.476">成真歌舞</span><span begin="1:21.476" end="1:22.098">升</span><span begin="1:22.098" end="1:24.038">平</span></p></div><div begin="1:24.333" end="2:06.111" itunes:songPart="Verse" ttm:agent="v2"><p begin="1:24.333" end="1:26.942" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:24.333" end="1:25.269">坐在航班上</span><span begin="1:25.269" end="1:26.644">一眼俯瞰过风景实在</span><span begin="1:26.644" end="1:26.942">好</span></p><p begin="1:26.950" end="1:29.558" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:26.950" end="1:28.318">得知下一站去虎山</span> <span begin="1:28.318" end="1:28.917">兴奋的我</span><span begin="1:28.917" end="1:29.558">睡不着</span></p><p begin="1:29.558" end="1:32.171" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:29.558" end="1:29.956">都说</span><span begin="1:29.956" end="1:30.162">虎</span><span begin="1:30.162" end="1:30.418">山</span><span begin="1:30.418" end="1:30.664">行</span> <span begin="1:30.664" end="1:32.171">那就拿好宰虎头的刀</span></p><p begin="1:32.171" end="1:34.760" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:32.171" end="1:32.916">俯瞰风景</span> <span begin="1:32.916" end="1:33.252">谁说</span><span begin="1:33.252" end="1:33.802">地下的故事</span><span begin="1:33.802" end="1:34.380">没有主流</span><span begin="1:34.380" end="1:34.480">的</span><span begin="1:34.480" end="1:34.760">骚</span></p><p begin="1:34.781" end="1:37.408" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:34.781" end="1:35.867">太多脑袋瓜们</span><span begin="1:35.867" end="1:36.952">还在幻想如何打</span><span begin="1:36.952" end="1:37.119">游</span><span begin="1:37.119" end="1:37.408">击</span></p><p begin="1:37.433" end="1:40.050" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:37.433" end="1:38.616">看我乾坤大挪移</span> <span begin="1:38.616" end="1:39.420">跳着押韵的</span><span begin="1:39.420" end="1:39.693">张无</span><span begin="1:39.693" end="1:40.050">忌</span></p><p begin="1:40.057" end="1:42.604" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:40.057" end="1:40.872">爆表的颜值</span><span begin="1:40.872" end="1:41.707">在实力面前</span><span begin="1:41.707" end="1:42.363">到底多无</span><span begin="1:42.363" end="1:42.604">力</span></p><p begin="1:42.605" end="1:45.196" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:42.605" end="1:43.605">送你中华曲的</span><span begin="1:43.605" end="1:43.843">力</span> <span begin="1:43.843" end="1:44.825">喂你吃东瀛调</span><span begin="1:44.825" end="1:44.991">的</span><span begin="1:44.991" end="1:45.196">屁</span></p><p begin="1:45.196" end="1:47.689" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:45.196" end="1:45.583">重庆</span><span begin="1:45.583" end="1:45.748">的</span><span begin="1:45.748" end="1:46.104">油</span><span begin="1:46.104" end="1:46.263">碟</span> <span begin="1:46.263" end="1:46.558">槟榔</span> <span begin="1:46.558" end="1:47.217">配上这杯</span><span begin="1:47.217" end="1:47.446">烈</span><span begin="1:47.446" end="1:47.689">酒</span></p><p begin="1:47.704" end="1:50.328" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:47.704" end="1:48.179">新疆的</span><span begin="1:48.179" end="1:49.483">儿子娃娃扭着钩子</span><span begin="1:49.483" end="1:50.001">快跟我</span><span begin="1:50.001" end="1:50.328">走</span></p><p begin="1:50.479" end="1:53.300" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:50.479" end="1:51.009">带你游</span><span begin="1:51.009" end="1:51.300">仙</span><span begin="1:51.300" end="1:51.492">岛</span> <span begin="1:51.492" end="1:51.975">摘仙</span><span begin="1:51.975" end="1:52.189">桃</span> <span begin="1:52.189" end="1:52.685">炼仙</span><span begin="1:52.685" end="1:52.872">丹</span> <span begin="1:52.872" end="1:53.300">采仙药</span></p><p begin="1:53.300" end="1:55.672" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:53.300" end="1:54.224">磨尖刀抓神仙</span> <span begin="1:54.224" end="1:55.327">再朝他B脸放鞭</span><span begin="1:55.327" end="1:55.672">炮</span></p><p begin="1:55.700" end="1:58.295" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:55.700" end="1:56.676">不管潮流在变</span> <span begin="1:56.676" end="1:57.777">我也要保持我的</span><span begin="1:57.777" end="1:57.992">主</span><span begin="1:57.992" end="1:58.295">观</span></p><p begin="1:58.300" end="2:00.932" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:58.300" end="1:59.410">用精湛的技巧把</span><span begin="1:59.410" end="1:59.616">hip-</span><span begin="1:59.616" end="1:59.766">hop